{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content .rsi/TASK.json -Raw; Write-Output \"-----\"; Get-ChildItem -Force | Select-Object Name'","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"taskId\": \"tf-0287-l05\",\n  \"sourceTaskId\": \"TF-0287\",\n  \"title\": \"Finite-state circuit breaker for abnormal call rates\",\n  \"baseCommit\": \"679b7124972f25a68d8ab15032afe4aee44ef19b\",\n  \"objective\": \"L05 为异常调用速率提供有限状态断路器：closed 累积窗口内失败，达阈值转 open 并在 cooldown 内拒绝（不再产生效果），cooldown 后转 half-open 只放行单个探测，探测成功回 closed、失败重新 open；纯合法速率永不误断。不与既有 budget/loop guard 重复，不放松 SSRF/loop guard/approval。\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    \"状态机有限且确定：closed -> open -> half-open -> (closed | open)；由注入时钟驱动，可重放。\",\n    \"open 在 cooldown 内拒绝请求（不再产生效果）；cooldown 结束转 half-open。\",\n    \"half-open 只放行 **单个** 探测；探测进行中不再放行第二个；探测成功回 closed，失败重新 open 并重置 cooldown。\",\n    \"纯合法速率（无失败）永不 trip；窗口滑动使旧失败过期，合法后续窗口不 false-trip。\",\n    \"断路器是速率边界而非生产默认；不替代/放松 SSRF、loop guard、approval 与既有 budget/loop guard（沿用 tool-loop-detection 正反回归）。\",\n    \"干净候选定向测试、runtime core 类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\"\n  ],\n  \"targetScope\": [\n    \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.ts\",\n    \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.test.ts\",\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-rate-circuit-breaker.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-rate-circuit-breaker.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-acceptance.json\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/L05-SHA256SUMS\"\n  ],\n  \"arm\": \"treatment\",\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the task in this repository. Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle. Do not install dependencies, use network, create loops/retries, or modify product locks. Report exact checks you actually ran.\"\n}\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nName\r\n----\r\n.agents\r\n.github\r\n.rsi\r\nartifacts\r